    "slug": "is-the-rog-crosshair-x870e-hero-worth-buying-in-singapore-specs-wifi-7-and-who-it-suits",
    "title": "Is the ROG Crosshair X870E Hero Worth Buying in Singapore? Specs, WiFi 7 and Who It Suits",
    "subtitle": "",
    "category": "Recommendation",
    "readTime": "7 min read",
    "publishDate": "Oct 10, 2026",
    "excerpt": "",
    "image": "https://eflfvugtdhvqkxahwmsh.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/article-images/guide-is-the-rog-crosshair-x870e-hero-worth-buying-in-singapore-specs-wifi-7-and-who-it-suits-1792004464910-ezw9o.jpeg",
    "featured": false,
